{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36618","headline":"春中湘中题岳麓寺僧舍 · 罗隐","name":"春中湘中题岳麓寺僧舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟾宫虎穴两皆休，来凭危栏送远愁。\n多事林莺还谩语，薄情边鴈不回头。\n春融只待乾坤醉，水阔深知世界浮。\n欲共高僧话心迹，野花芳草奈相尤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}